{
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "start": 3.5,
   "end": 7.66,
   "text": "I close a clothing store at the mall. Alone. Every night."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 8.36,
   "end": 15.379,
   "text": "My manager gave me one rule. After the mall lights go out, if a fitting room is locked... don't look under the door."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 15.979,
   "end": 19.712,
   "text": "Just knock twice, say \"we're closed,\" and walk away."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 20.512,
   "end": 24.224,
   "text": "For a whole year, every door swung open empty."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 24.824,
   "end": 29.859,
   "text": "Then one night, right after the big lights shut off, fitting room six was locked."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 30.559,
   "end": 32.031,
   "text": "I knocked twice."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 34.431,
   "end": 40.127,
   "text": "\"We're closed.\" No answer. No breathing. Just the hum of the lights... and my own heartbeat."
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 41.127,
   "end": 43.089,
   "text": "I should have walked away."
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 44.189,
   "end": 48.584,
   "text": "Instead, I got down on the cold floor... and looked under the door."
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 49.584,
   "end": 54.363,
   "text": "White sneakers. Scuffed toes. One red lace... exactly like mine."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 55.763,
   "end": 59.645,
   "text": "Then the lock clicked... and the door swung slowly open."
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 61.645,
   "end": 66.019,
   "text": "The room was empty. Just the tall mirror... and me, kneeling in it."
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 67.319,
   "end": 70.817,
   "text": "I looked down. I was kneeling there in my socks."
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "start": 72.417,
   "end": 77.58,
   "text": "And out in the dark mall... I heard my own footsteps, walking toward the exit."
  }
 ],
